  "body": "Looks like this is not related to device, since tried on different with the same result: Sennheiser, Jabra, Poly. \r\nIf you connect one of listed USB headset and add inputReport listener, you will find that on pressing mute button you receive 2 reports in  a sequence first with value 1 and second with value 0.  The sequence is always the same: 1 then 0.\r\n ",
